{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"정사각형 넓이","desc":"<p>한 변의 길이가 <code>side</code>인 정사각형의 <b>넓이</b>를 돌려주는 함수 <code>square_area(side)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def square_area(side):\n    pass\n","solution":"def square_area(side):\n    return side * side\n","hint":"<p>넓이 = 한 변 × 한 변</p>","tests":[{"call":"square_area(4)","expected":16,"visible":true},{"call":"square_area(0)","expected":0,"visible":true},{"call":"square_area(2.5)","expected":6.25,"visible":false},{"call":"square_area(10)","expected":100,"visible":false}],"id":"py-296"}